<h2>Category one: architect-led design studios</h2>
<p>These firms are led by architects or trained designers, take a limited number of concurrent projects, and produce work that is defensibly authored. Design fees typically run 8–20% of project value on top of execution. This is where you go if you want a residence that reads as a piece of design rather than an installation of finishes.</p>
